{"id":"05b9365d1157edb4884533e72a786ead88838676","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1239128","title":"Deepseek 三小时不到就耗了 30 块","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"imingyu","excerpt":"程序员 - @imingyu - 我用 opencode 连 v4 pro （ ds 官网），连之前冲了 50 块（人民币），coding 一会后到控制台一看只剩 20 余一点了。开发的功能就是在本地爬一些数据，然后在本地写","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>我用 opencode 连 v4 pro （ ds 官网），连之前冲了 50 块（人民币），coding 一会后到控制台一看只剩 20 余一点了。</p>\n<p>开发的功能就是在本地爬一些数据，然后在本地写 web ui 渲染出来。</p>\n<p>这个花费是正常的吗？想问问大家的情况是怎么样的</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/耗费\"><li></li> 耗费</a><a href=\"/tag/成本\"><li></li> 成本</a><a href=\"/tag/正常\"><li></li> 正常</a></P><p><span>36 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-03 23:58:05 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18045472\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a178/3dde/176207_normal.png?m=1532754965\" alt=\"codelover2016\" data-uid=\"176207\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/codelover2016\">codelover2016</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 10:39:36 +08:00\">21h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>1 、用 Flash ，Pro 是不便宜的<br>2 、做点自己的 Skills ，还是能省一点 Token 的<br>3 、试试 DeepSeek Harness ，这边也是省不少的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18045699\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6407/57f2/791213_normal.png?m=1772691973\" alt=\"evilHa\" data-uid=\"791213\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/evilHa\">evilHa</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 11:09:40 +08:00\">21h 11m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>是不是把爬的数据搞到大模型里了让大模型判断什么了，按理说不应该这么费。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18045719\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0d45b7a7ca9de80b6e33af28ffd98ec6?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"liansishen\" data-uid=\"575025\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/liansishen\">liansishen</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 11:12:32 +08:00\">21h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>高峰期的 pro 直接用 api 价格是特别贵的<br>建议改用 flash ，能力差不不大</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18045722\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a6be/bbe3/32362_normal.png?m=1720085134\" alt=\"46fo\" data-uid=\"32362\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/46fo\">46fo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 11:13:25 +08:00\">21h 7m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>用 opencode go 套餐</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18045740\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2689dc7f22e52784aab2795f6772ce72?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"lp7631010\" data-uid=\"277938\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lp7631010\">lp7631010</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 11:15:51 +08:00\">21h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我一般用它解决点电脑上或者局域网内的问题   一次冲个 2 块钱  每次很快就用完了 确实不便宜</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18045753\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ea75/9dd5/216620_normal.png?m=1738891338\" alt=\"ayyll\" data-uid=\"216620\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ayyll\">ayyll</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 11:17:11 +08:00\">21h 4m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>用这个基元律动试试 可以薅 68 块钱的额度，自己搞小号注册自己邀请自己 最高能薅 680 能免费蹬一个月 几乎无限量了 链接好像站内不让发 邀请码 rf_tr_oMJiwClX1kgY8Dpc6vZihw_I</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18045763\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1573/c46f/195251_normal.png?m=1764573061\" alt=\"filtrate\" data-uid=\"195251\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/filtrate\">filtrate</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 11:18:18 +08:00\">21h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>DeepSeek  缓存命中率不高的时候很贵</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18045857\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/30fb34a38838fd272a87fe242134fb13?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"generated\" data-uid=\"481228\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/generated\">generated</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 11:29:13 +08:00\">20h 52m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>&gt; 本地爬一些数据</p><p>是不是爬的数据也进入对话了？如果只是写代码的话用不了这么多吧</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18046008\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d562d60c4af0f8920499023b86bc25b0?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"indexError\" data-uid=\"577047\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/indexError\">indexError</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 11:49:52 +08:00\">20h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>deepseek 涨价之前，我一下午也花过三四十。如果要求高反复修改，更贵。<br>速度快，按时间算花的肯定多。<br>你看看论坛，没多少讨论 deepseek harness 和 deepseek 模型的了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18046041\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5719/62a6/20396_normal.png?m=1742907758\" alt=\"ihciah\" data-uid=\"20396\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ihciah\">ihciah</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 11:54:58 +08:00\">20h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>dsh 用 flash 也是，一个小活最后花了非常多，算下来比 gpt 订阅贵。感觉是交互轮数太多了，就看着 cache 命中特别高最后也没省钱。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18046049\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5682d48e962c52eec541d89a476cceb8?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"mechunjun\" data-uid=\"413420\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/mechunjun\">mechunjun</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 11:56:04 +08:00\">20h 25m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>比 fable 便宜多了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18046051\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/de44ac9acf69b3c09830ad1fda779756?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"pandalvgoo\" data-uid=\"845324\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/pandalvgoo\">pandalvgoo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 11:56:16 +08:00\">20h 24m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>干正经活的话，Coding Plan 是必须的。纯 API 需要很细致的编排。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18046223\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/11822edc4b3c35c89dfd3b833f45b426?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"foryou2023\" data-uid=\"626307\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/foryou2023\">foryou2023</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 12:47:05 +08:00\">19h 34m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>v4flash ，空闲大概 12 元 1 亿 token ，高峰 24 元 1 亿 token 。<br>v4pro 是 v4flash 的 3 倍。</p><p>api 一天花费超过 10 块钱，我个人认为就要上订阅了，订阅更划算。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18046227\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/eefece6de7a8cd6ba5bbde2a73fde7f7?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"nakun233\" data-uid=\"627181\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/nakun233\">nakun233</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 12:48:09 +08:00\">19h 33m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>国产其实也不便宜，什么时候算力上来啊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18046233\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ddd927d69f7ccbf8e9b5a77c7b8500f5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yinmin\" data-uid=\"108246\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yinmin\">yinmin</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 12:50:06 +08:00\">19h 31m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这类任务可以试试 glm 5.3 flash ，性价比高</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18046356\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/70de/a3d7/201036_normal.png?m=1581594878\" alt=\"wjjwkwindy\" data-uid=\"201036\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wjjwkwindy\">wjjwkwindy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 13:27:49 +08:00\">18h 53m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>api 用起来确实很贵，有些任务我都是拖到中午或者晚上再跑</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18046358\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/40eaa45a823f075189ca2a4f76343678?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jackOff\" data-uid=\"593397\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jackOff\">jackOff</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 13:28:19 +08:00\">18h 52m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>千问 3.8 flash 怎么样，能不能成为 deepseek v4 flash 的有效替代品？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18046620\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b0be/b298/70195_normal.png?m=1494316022\" alt=\"BornThisWay\" data-uid=\"70195\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/BornThisWay\">BornThisWay</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 14:17:59 +08:00\">18h 3m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>codingplan 用 glm 5.3 flash 真的秒了<br>ds 太贵了已经没性价比了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18046647\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/56c51007330840bea223cbcb36203a38?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ashuai\" data-uid=\"9636\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ashuai\">ashuai</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 14:21:46 +08:00\">17h 59m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/jackOff\">jackOff</a> glm 5.3 flash 价格低得令人发指，和 ds4 flash 半斤八两</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18046649\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/55579e415f3d312d5b8905b3b9ec0761?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"longaiwp\" data-uid=\"139260\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/longaiwp\">longaiwp</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 14:22:13 +08:00\">17h 59m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>Pro 性价比太差，用 Flash 就好了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18046671\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9e01bac5f530448d3b2547cf8f7e3054?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"qiuzhang\" data-uid=\"30186\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/qiuzhang\">qiuzhang</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 14:25:28 +08:00\">17h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>ds 已经不敢用了，一个项目写了 PRD ，一共 12 项，第一项就用了 40 多。赶紧放弃了。用不起了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18046743\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cc1d/9600/656439_normal.png?m=1744254258\" alt=\"6581\" data-uid=\"656439\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>26</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/6581\">6581</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 14:38:44 +08:00\">17h 42m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>deepseek 放弃把，一句话 1 块钱，太贵了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18046824\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/b1ce534efa8022afb7587acc1d8d9c53?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"vcfeee\" data-uid=\"474049\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>27</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/vcfeee\">vcfeee</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 14:52:46 +08:00\">17h 28m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>高峰的时候 1 小时 10 块差不多就是这个数</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18046841\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5b249b0ab1773d62593b42a5de3e3ced?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"goophy\" data-uid=\"4598\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>28</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/goophy\">goophy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 14:55:01 +08:00\">17h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>glm 5.3 flash</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18046924\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7588/3375/274860_normal.png?m=1712309785\" alt=\"Ipsum\" data-uid=\"274860\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>29</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Ipsum\">Ipsum</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 15:10:11 +08:00\">17h 11m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>一般 flash 就够了，除非你多模态</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18047039\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/aeb0/c0ec/604449_normal.png?m=1785201732\" alt=\"ShiBuYi\" data-uid=\"604449\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>30</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ShiBuYi\">ShiBuYi</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 15:29:33 +08:00\">16h 51m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我直接换了 cursor, 因为 ds 现在上班根本用不起</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18047047\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/93c307f34530b473663c1976d0711559?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"chenluo0429\" data-uid=\"330532\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>31</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/chenluo0429\">chenluo0429</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 15:31:27 +08:00\">16h 49m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>非常正常。相比涨价之前，v4f 的谷价大约是 2 倍，峰价大约是 4 倍。v4p 的谷价大约是 3.5 - 4.5 倍，峰价大约是 7 - 9 倍。<br>不仅仅是 ds ，其他家模型也是一样，除了分析，设计，讨论，审查这种发散性任务要用高级模型，其他明确的，重复的，低复杂度任务，都建议用快速模型。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18048008\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c64bdab13743b587a8d1f18de3502b13?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"zturns\" data-uid=\"360017\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>33</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zturns\">zturns</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 19:14:54 +08:00\">13h 6m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>v4 flash 没套餐也是用不起了，烧得太快了，2 个问题 2 块多才用了 1000 多万 token ，贵的一批</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18048557\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/35d5/0d5a/268845_normal.png?m=1614593196\" alt=\"yinanc\" data-uid=\"268845\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>36</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yinanc\">yinanc</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 23:58:05 +08:00\">8h 23m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>ds 官方 api 从来都不便宜，就算在涨价前性价比都远不如 opencode go ，真不知道为什么有这么多自己掏钱用官方 api 的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"我用 opencode 连 v4 pro （ ds 官网），连之前冲了 50 块（人民币），coding 一会后到控制台一看只剩 20 余一点了。 开发的功能就是在本地爬一些数据，然后在本地写 web ui 渲染出来。 这个花费是正常的吗？想问问大家的情况是怎么样的 耗费 成本 正常36 replies • 2026-09-03 23:58:05 +08:00 1 codelover2016 21h 41m ago 1 、用 Flash ，Pro 是不便宜的2 、做点自己的 Skills ，还是能省一点 Token 的3 、试试 DeepSeek Harness ，这边也是省不少的。 3 evilHa 21h 11m ago 是不是把爬的数据搞到大模型里了让大模型判断什么了，按理说不应该这么费。 4 liansishen 21h 8m ago 高峰期的 pro 直接用 api 价格是特别贵的建议改用 flash ，能力差不不大 5 46fo 21h 7m ago 用 opencode go 套餐 6 lp7631010 21h 5m ago 我一般用它解决点电脑上或者局域网内的问题 一次冲个 2 块钱 每次很快就用完了 确实不便宜 7 ayyll 21h 4m ago 用这个基元律动试试 可以薅 68 块钱的额度，自己搞小号注册自己邀请自己 最高能薅 680 能免费蹬一个月 几乎无限量了 链接好像站内不让发 邀请码 rf_tr_oMJiwClX1kgY8Dpc6vZihw_I 8 filtra